**Было:**
```dl
( $ ) => {
    import ./providers.dl;
    ...
}
```

**Стало:**
```dl
( $, $config ) => {
    import ./providers.dl;
    import ./mcp.dl;
    import ./permissions.dl;
    import ./agents.dl;
    import ./runtime.dl;
}
```

**Проверка:**
```bash
uv run dl build examples/flake.dl --no-progress
cat examples/opencode.json | python3 -m json.tool | head -30
```

